  "description": "Sold by his debt-ridden father to the Cavertia Ducal House, Ashe was content with his new life as a slave. But his peaceful days come to an end when he suddenly presents as an omega. Thrown into the bedroom of Duke Opelta Cavertia—his master, a notorious alpha with rumors of ruthless and sadistic treatment towards omegas, he finds himself dragged into a private “training” regime. Caught between embarrassment and overwhelming pleasure, how long can this innocent slave survive the intoxicating dominance of the Duke?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Part of Daiwon's Neungyonk BL Danpyeon (능욕BL단편) Collection.*",
